-- Project Euler 30: Digit fifth powers
-- The sum of every number that equals the sum of the fifth powers of its digits.
-- Answer: 443839
--
-- The upper bound is the arithmetic, not a guess: six digits of 9 give
-- 6 * 9^5 = 354294, and a seven-digit number cannot reach its own value, so
-- nothing above that can qualify.

import core, list, math, euler in

	range 10 354295
	> filter (n -> eq n (digits n > map (pow 5) > sum))
	> sum
	> show
